          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Eight to twelve years maintained, four to
            six neglected</strong> — and the ratio holds at every price tier,
            because the failure mechanism is heat rather than wear. Maintenance
            multiplies whatever the machine was capable of; it does not add a
            fixed number of years.
          </p>
